# Lab Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Endpoint["Monitored Endpoint (Windows 10/11 VM)"]
        A[Sysmon] --> B[Wazuh Agent]
    end

    B -->|Encrypted log forwarding| C[Wazuh Manager<br/>or Security Onion]

    subgraph Detection["Detection Layer"]
        C --> D[Built-in Wazuh Rules]
        C --> E[Custom Sigma Rules]
    end

    D --> F[Alerts / Dashboard]
    E --> F

    F --> G[Analyst Investigation]
    G --> H[Documentation in docs/]
    G --> I[MITRE ATT&CK Mapping]

    subgraph Simulation["Attack Simulation"]
        J[Atomic Red Team] -->|Generates telemetry| A
    end
```

## Component Notes

- **Sysmon** provides high-fidelity process, network, and file-event
  telemetry beyond default Windows logging.
- **Wazuh Agent** forwards Sysmon and Windows Security Event Log data to
  the manager.
- **Wazuh Manager / Security Onion** ingests logs and runs both built-in
  and custom detection rules.
- **Atomic Red Team** simulates the attacker behaviors this lab is built
  to detect, in a safe, scoped, and repeatable way.
